      "id": "01KYXKRGJQ6HHJ6KPFCR506KQV",
      "storyId": "01KYXBHD0K6DRY76ZD6ZWKKM1K",
      "title": "Three of Everything",
      "body": "Every choice in the bears' house comes in three: the porridge is too hot, too cold, or just right; the chairs are too hard, too soft, or just right; the beds are too hard, too soft, or just right. Goldilocks tries all three every time, and it's always Baby Bear's that fits her best.",
